{"4701660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DRIFTERS: Blackout Crew", "steam_appid": 4701660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIFTERS: Blackout Crew is a PvE co-op VR extraction shooter where your crew raids ancient alien temples to keep a dying mothership alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in deep space and running on emergency power, your ship survives on what you steal. Raid with up to four players, drop into hostile temple complexes, and fight through ancient machines guarding impossible energy systems older than anyone understands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Deeper or Extract</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each temple is an ancient energy system waiting to be cracked open. Scout the route, scavenge rare materials, activate alien machinery, and fight through escalating defenses. Steal what you can, protect what you’re carrying, and get out before the temple turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/8713813791af3120e591792113108d2f.poster.avif?t=1784552271\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/8713813791af3120e591792113108d2f.webm?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/8713813791af3120e591792113108d2f.mp4?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Every Raid Into Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back on the mothership, turn stolen energy and rare resources into weapon parts, suit upgrades, alien research, and new tools for the next raid. Shape your build, support your crew, and prepare for the next drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/5bd22699eedaed5b1867a41336f94b7f.poster.avif?t=1784552271\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/5bd22699eedaed5b1867a41336f94b7f.webm?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/5bd22699eedaed5b1867a41336f94b7f.mp4?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Co-op VR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for VR from the ground up</strong>, DRIFTERS puts every action in your hands: handle weapons, reload under pressure, grab loot, use wrist-mounted tools, revive teammates, cover your squad, and fight your way back to extraction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the Creators of Sweet Surrender</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRIFTERS: Blackout Crew is built by a VR-first team with years of experience supporting and improving our games alongside the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to help shape what comes next? <strong>Join our Discord</strong>, follow development, and sign up for upcoming playtests.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIFTERS: Blackout Crew is a PvE co-op VR extraction shooter where your crew raids ancient alien temples to keep a dying mothership alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in deep space and running on emergency power, your ship survives on what you steal. Raid with up to four players, drop into hostile temple complexes, and fight through ancient machines guarding impossible energy systems older than anyone understands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Deeper or Extract</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each temple is an ancient energy system waiting to be cracked open. Scout the route, scavenge rare materials, activate alien machinery, and fight through escalating defenses. Steal what you can, protect what you’re carrying, and get out before the temple turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/8713813791af3120e591792113108d2f.poster.avif?t=1784552271\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/8713813791af3120e591792113108d2f.webm?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/8713813791af3120e591792113108d2f.mp4?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Every Raid Into Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back on the mothership, turn stolen energy and rare resources into weapon parts, suit upgrades, alien research, and new tools for the next raid. Shape your build, support your crew, and prepare for the next drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/5bd22699eedaed5b1867a41336f94b7f.poster.avif?t=1784552271\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/5bd22699eedaed5b1867a41336f94b7f.webm?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/extras/5bd22699eedaed5b1867a41336f94b7f.mp4?t=1784552271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Co-op VR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for VR from the ground up</strong>, DRIFTERS puts every action in your hands: handle weapons, reload under pressure, grab loot, use wrist-mounted tools, revive teammates, cover your squad, and fight your way back to extraction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the Creators of Sweet Surrender</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRIFTERS: Blackout Crew is built by a VR-first team with years of experience supporting and improving our games alongside the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to help shape what comes next? <strong>Join our Discord</strong>, follow development, and sign up for upcoming playtests.</p>", "short_description": "Raid ancient alien temples in a PvE co-op extraction shooter built for tactile VR gunplay. Steal energy for your dying mothership, scavenge rare resources, survive the temple’s defense systems, and decide how deep your crew can push before extraction turns desperate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/9df5efee6cabf966b42962cc5ad4e33aa9aa1274/header.jpg?t=1784552271", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/0756ee44e06e9dcb14b17941397472354b6bd4ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784552271", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701660/0756ee44e06e9dcb14b17941397472354b6bd4ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784552271", "website": "https://playdrifters.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R290 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, requires motion controllers</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "develo